---
layout: base.njk
title: "Join Mensa - Greater Los Angeles Area Mensa"
---

<!-- Hero Section -->
<section class="relative bg-brand-primary py-24 sm:py-32 overflow-hidden isolate">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[radial-gradient(45rem_50rem_at_top,theme(colors.blue.400),theme(colors.blue.900))] opacity-50"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-y-0 right-1/2 -z-10 mr-16 w-[200%] origin-bottom-left skew-x-[-30deg] bg-white opacity-5 shadow-xl ring-1 shadow-blue-100/20 ring-blue-50 sm:mr-28 lg:mr-0 xl:mr-16 xl:origin-center"></div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center animate-fade-in-up">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
      Your Invitation to Join
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-xl leading-relaxed text-blue-100 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Membership in Mensa is open to persons who have attained a score within the upper two percent of the general population on an approved intelligence test. There is no other qualification or disqualification.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Pathways Section -->
<section class="py-24 bg-bg-subtle relative -mt-16 z-10">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl">Two Ways to Qualify</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-600">Choose the path that works best for you to officially join our ranks.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      
      <!-- Pathway 1: Take the Test -->
      <div class="group relative bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-lg ring-1 ring-gray-900/5 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-2xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 -mr-8 -mt-8 w-32 h-32 bg-blue-50 rounded-full blur-2xl group-hover:bg-blue-100 transition-colors"></div>
        
        <div class="text-brand-primary mb-6 relative">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15.232 5.232l3.536 3.536m-2.036-5.036a2.5 2.5 0 113.536 3.536L6.5 21.036H3v-3.572L16.732 3.732z"></path></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 relative">Take the Mensa Test</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8 flex-grow relative">
          Sit for the official Mensa Admissions Test. These tests are supervised by certified proctors. You can easily find an upcoming local testing session through the national portal.
        </p>
        
        <a href="https://www.us.mensa.org/join/testing/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex justify-center items-center rounded-xl bg-brand-primary px-6 py-4 text-base font-bold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-blue-800 transition-colors w-full relative z-10">
          Find a Testing Session
          <svg class="ml-2 w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Pathway 2: Prior Evidence -->
      <div class="group relative bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-lg ring-1 ring-gray-900/5 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-2xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 -mr-8 -mt-8 w-32 h-32 bg-yellow-50 rounded-full blur-2xl group-hover:bg-yellow-100 transition-colors"></div>
        
        <div class="text-brand-accent mb-6 relative">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-yellow-50 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 relative">Submit Prior Evidence</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8 flex-grow relative">
          Submit a qualifying score from another supervised standardized test. Many people find this a quick and easy way to qualify on tests they have already taken (e.g. LSAT, GMAT, and certain older SAT/ACTs).
        </p>
        
        <a href="https://www.us.mensa.org/join/testscores/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex justify-center items-center rounded-xl bg-gray-900 px-6 py-4 text-base font-bold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-gray-800 transition-colors w-full relative z-10">
          Check Qualifying Tests
          <svg class="ml-2 w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Maintenance & Local Info -->
<section class="py-24 bg-white border-t border-gray-100">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12">
      
      <!-- FAQ / Local Needs -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Need Local Testing Accommodations?</h3>
        <div class="prose prose-blue text-gray-600">
          <p>
            Locally, qualification tests are arranged and overseen by our GLAAM Testing Coordinator. Mensa tests must be supervised by certified proctors, and we are incredibly grateful to our volunteers who make this possible.
          </p>
          <p>
            While the national portal linked above is the fastest way to find a standard testing session, if you need special accommodations or have specific questions about local logistics, you can find the current Testing Coordinator's phone number on our <a href="/contact" class="text-brand-primary font-semibold hover:underline">Contact page</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Current Member Maintenance -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-gray-50 rounded-3xl p-8 border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 mr-2 text-brand-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
          Already a Member?
        </h3>
        
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="flex flex-col">
            <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Membership Renewal</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3 mt-1">The Mensa membership year begins April 1 and ends March 31.</p>
            <a href="https://www.us.mensa.org/join/renew/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-primary font-bold hover:text-blue-800 transition-colors inline-flex items-center">
              Renew your membership &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
          
          <hr class="border-gray-200">
          
          <div class="flex flex-col">
            <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Rejoin Mensa</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3 mt-1">Has your membership lapsed? Rejoining is easy; you don’t even need to take the test again!</p>
            <a href="https://www.us.mensa.org/join/rejoin/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-primary font-bold hover:text-blue-800 transition-colors inline-flex items-center">
              Reactivate your account &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
